{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Seafare <a href=\"mailto:&lt;\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588@seafare.org&gt;\">&lt;\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588@seafare.org&gt;</a></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Subject: Outreach Initiative</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dear Volunteer,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for participating in our Seafare Outreach Initiative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will be fixing errors by hitting sheet music notes in our Clef Debug Program.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No coding or music experience necessary. Everything will be taught to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Best,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Management</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Replies and messages sent to this email address will be ignored. If you would like to report an issue to Seafare, <strong><u>contact us</u></strong>.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>(View Email Attachments: 2)\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146170/extras/a3cb2a1f2ff882149e22a0688a31b9fb.poster.avif?t=1762738601\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146170/extras/a3cb2a1f2ff882149e22a0688a31b9fb.webm?t=1762738601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146170/extras/a3cb2a1f2ff882149e22a0688a31b9fb.mp4?t=1762738601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146170/extras/1dabf2699e941947